# Research notes: never commit. This repository is public and the notes
# contain transcript grades, a capstone provenance finding and pointers to
# personal data in other repositories. They live in the private repository
# Zariffdn/portfolio-notes, cloned into docs/private/. The three paths below
# are where they used to sit and stay ignored in case an old copy remains.
docs/private/
docs/MATRICULATION.md
docs/DEGREE.md
docs/BOOTCAMP.md

# Photo originals stay local. src/Assets/me.png is an older headshot, and
# nothing made from it is committed. src/Assets/formal_pic.jpeg is the
# original of the About photo, which is committed only as
# src/Assets/me-1254.webp, a full-size WebP copy with no metadata (the
# original carries its editing app's EXIF and an embedded thumbnail).
src/Assets/me.png
src/Assets/formal_pic.jpeg

# The bag lock exhibition photo shows the FYP poster with a student photo and
# names and a filled-in marking form; only the crop in
# src/Assets/Projects/baglock.jpg is committed.
src/Assets/Baglock.jpg
src/Assets/prototype.jpg
